    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/788811fc9bbf3649b6edca2ea56d2339.poster.avif?t=1748031926\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/788811fc9bbf3649b6edca2ea56d2339.webm?t=1748031926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/788811fc9bbf3649b6edca2ea56d2339.mp4?t=1748031926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to bounce, squish, and launch your way through a world of fun in &quot;Jeller Fellers&quot;! In this charming but challenging physics-based 3D platformer, you are a wiggly wobbly jelly cube that must navigate through the various environments collecting Jelly beans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/43466e5e4fec9ffd24395f2b5278e1f2.poster.avif?t=1748031926\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/43466e5e4fec9ffd24395f2b5278e1f2.webm?t=1748031926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/43466e5e4fec9ffd24395f2b5278e1f2.mp4?t=1748031926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative physics-based Gameplay: Experience a unique control system where every movement, jump, and interaction is influenced by the physics of your jelly cube. Master the art of bouncing and stretching to overcome every obstacle in your path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/aadf422abf28e07a2c994a7e8cb3b246.poster.avif?t=1748031926\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/aadf422abf28e07a2c994a7e8cb3b246.webm?t=1748031926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/aadf422abf28e07a2c994a7e8cb3b246.mp4?t=1748031926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles and Challenges: Solve engaging puzzles and tackle tricky platforming sections. Use your jelly-like abilities to find creative solutions and discover hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/89a6586caa9e8205b95ab741ed229ba6.poster.avif?t=1748031926\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/89a6586caa9e8205b95ab741ed229ba6.webm?t=1748031926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/89a6586caa9e8205b95ab741ed229ba6.mp4?t=1748031926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectibles and Customization: Collect jelly beans and jelly crystals scattered throughout the levels to unlock new skins and accessories for your Jeller. Make your Jeller truly your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/42e6da766bf09fdda36aa752eaac550b.poster.avif?t=1748031926\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/42e6da766bf09fdda36aa752eaac550b.webm?t=1748031926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/42e6da766bf09fdda36aa752eaac550b.mp4?t=1748031926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/788811fc9bbf3649b6edca2ea56d2339.poster.avif?t=1748031926\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/788811fc9bbf3649b6edca2ea56d2339.webm?t=1748031926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/788811fc9bbf3649b6edca2ea56d2339.mp4?t=1748031926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to bounce, squish, and launch your way through a world of fun in &quot;Jeller Fellers&quot;! In this charming but challenging physics-based 3D platformer, you are a wiggly wobbly jelly cube that must navigate through the various environments collecting Jelly beans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/43466e5e4fec9ffd24395f2b5278e1f2.poster.avif?t=1748031926\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/43466e5e4fec9ffd24395f2b5278e1f2.webm?t=1748031926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/43466e5e4fec9ffd24395f2b5278e1f2.mp4?t=1748031926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Innovative physics-based Gameplay: Experience a unique control system where every movement, jump, and interaction is influenced by the physics of your jelly cube. Master the art of bouncing and stretching to overcome every obstacle in your path!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/aadf422abf28e07a2c994a7e8cb3b246.poster.avif?t=1748031926\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/aadf422abf28e07a2c994a7e8cb3b246.webm?t=1748031926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/aadf422abf28e07a2c994a7e8cb3b246.mp4?t=1748031926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles and Challenges: Solve engaging puzzles and tackle tricky platforming sections. Use your jelly-like abilities to find creative solutions and discover hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/89a6586caa9e8205b95ab741ed229ba6.poster.avif?t=1748031926\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/89a6586caa9e8205b95ab741ed229ba6.webm?t=1748031926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/89a6586caa9e8205b95ab741ed229ba6.mp4?t=1748031926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectibles and Customization: Collect jelly beans and jelly crystals scattered throughout the levels to unlock new skins and accessories for your Jeller. Make your Jeller truly your own!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/42e6da766bf09fdda36aa752eaac550b.poster.avif?t=1748031926\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/42e6da766bf09fdda36aa752eaac550b.webm?t=1748031926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2451550/extras/42e6da766bf09fdda36aa752eaac550b.mp4?t=1748031926\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Bounce, squish, and launch through a vibrant, stylized world in Jeller Fellers, where you *attempt* to control a wobbly jelly cube. Solve puzzles, overcome obstacles, and explore diverse environments in this challenging, physics-based precision platformer",
